WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
ANU. Learn. Practice. Progress. Actual product screens move behind the opening words.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
Find your next module. The camera enters the actual My Learning interface and moves toward the modules and topic list. Demo data is used throughout.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.800
Open a topic. Go deeper. A cursor opens Anatomical Landmarks and moves to the MindSparks View Questions button.

00:12.800 --> 00:17.500
Review MindSparks. The actual question-viewing modal opens, showing two sample questions and their options.

00:17.500 --> 00:23.500
See the score. Review the answers. The cursor opens Score. The attempt details show sample scores and selected and correct answers.

00:23.500 --> 00:29.000
Keep practice in the same workflow. The Practice filter displays four practice resources. The Image Interpretation filter then displays interpretation resources and View Scores controls.

00:29.000 --> 00:37.000
Bring it all into focus. The actual dashboard appears. Camera moves show performance metrics, competency scores, and a skill gap using illustrative data.

00:37.000 --> 00:42.000
Keep your learning path in view. The dashboard shows Learning Path Progress and Resource Progress, followed by a quick montage of the product.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.000
ANU. One place. Every next step. Ultrasound learning, connected. Discover ANU.
